WEBVTT

00:29.200 --> 00:33.870
I received Rudeus as a gift
for my fifteenth birthday.

00:34.700 --> 00:37.410
It was a little different from
what he promised,

00:37.410 --> 00:39.530
but I'd been bound to Rudeus.

00:41.590 --> 00:43.270
So small.

00:46.320 --> 00:50.420
But I always end up getting saved.

00:51.700 --> 00:55.530
I'm not good enough for Rudeus.

01:09.310 --> 01:12.060
Eris...

02:26.710 --> 02:27.550
What?

02:27.550 --> 02:29.090
Who's that?

02:29.090 --> 02:32.510
Isn't that Ghislaine?

02:32.510 --> 02:34.390
Stop the training!

02:34.390 --> 02:36.340
All of you, go to the Sword Hall!

02:44.140 --> 02:49.020
MUSHOKU TENSEI: JOBLESS REINCARNATION SEASON 3

03:07.510 --> 03:10.630
Hey, Ghislaine.
You're still alive, huh?

03:10.970 --> 03:12.920
It's been a long time, Master.

03:13.670 --> 03:16.390
I thought you were dead somewhere.

03:16.390 --> 03:18.950
You're in better shape than I expected.

03:18.950 --> 03:20.890
And who's that girl?

03:20.890 --> 03:23.150
This is Eris, my disciple.

03:23.150 --> 03:26.230
I brought her here because
I wanted Master to train her.

03:26.560 --> 03:29.750
Oh? You want me to train her?

03:31.470 --> 03:34.230
I don't have any use
for a small fry like you!

03:36.280 --> 03:39.020
How dare you insult Master!

03:39.020 --> 03:40.250
On your knees!

03:40.250 --> 03:43.200
The person in front of you
is Sword God Gal Farion!

03:43.200 --> 03:45.310
I was surprised that
you came back so suddenly,

03:45.310 --> 03:47.210
but what did you teach her?!

03:47.210 --> 03:50.180
- Teach her the etiquette first!
- Why don't you teach her yourself?

03:50.180 --> 03:51.490
Hurry up and get out of here!

03:51.490 --> 03:52.130
Be quiet.

03:53.500 --> 03:55.970
I like the look in your eyes.

03:55.970 --> 03:58.300
Who exactly do you want to kill?

03:58.300 --> 03:59.800
The Dragon God.

03:59.800 --> 04:01.810
Dragon God Orsted.

04:02.430 --> 04:03.830
- Dragon God?
- She said the Dragon God?

04:03.830 --> 04:05.890
- Is he one of the Seven Great Powers?
- Who is Orsted?

04:05.890 --> 04:08.130
- Almost no one knows his real name.
- Who would deal with him?!

04:09.900 --> 04:11.270
I see!

04:11.270 --> 04:14.650
I'm indeed a small fry
compared to Orsted.

04:14.650 --> 04:18.149
I see. You wanna kill him, eh?

04:18.709 --> 04:22.160
I never thought I'd meet someone
who wanted to kill him besides me.

04:27.460 --> 04:31.680
However, talk is cheap.

04:31.680 --> 04:33.170
Can you do it?

04:33.170 --> 04:34.300
I will.

04:41.680 --> 04:43.400
Let's see your swordsmanship.

04:43.400 --> 04:44.020
- Gino, be her opponent.
- What?

04:44.020 --> 04:45.580
- Gino, be her opponent.
- Why someone like her?

04:45.580 --> 04:47.270
Huh?! Y-Yes, sir!

04:47.270 --> 04:49.840
He's our youngest student.

04:49.840 --> 04:52.820
He's still soft,
but he's pretty skilled.

04:58.820 --> 05:00.150
Then, to the center...

05:17.200 --> 05:19.210
See? He's soft, isn't he?

05:19.900 --> 05:21.590
No kidding.

05:22.490 --> 05:24.910
You're up next, Nina.

05:25.670 --> 05:26.890
Yes, sir!

05:26.890 --> 05:29.270
Face each other properly this time.

05:29.270 --> 05:30.390
A surprise attack is okay,

05:30.800 --> 05:33.620
but I'd like to see how you fight
sword to sword.

05:48.950 --> 05:49.950
I'll kill her.

05:51.740 --> 05:52.250
Begin!

06:16.710 --> 06:18.450
S-Stop!

06:18.450 --> 06:19.520
That's enough!

06:38.450 --> 06:40.960
Do you have anyone
who isn't soft here?!

06:40.960 --> 06:42.240
H-How dare you!

06:42.240 --> 06:43.550
Are you here to humiliate us?!

06:43.550 --> 06:45.770
- Know your place!
- Is that even a sword match?!

06:45.770 --> 06:49.230
Sorry, guess I underestimated you a bit.

06:51.250 --> 06:53.230
I'll be your opponent.

06:53.230 --> 06:55.450
You don't need to
face her yourself, Master.

06:55.450 --> 06:56.270
Allow me...

07:02.280 --> 07:06.210
Don't get too worked up.
I'll hold myself back.

07:06.210 --> 07:08.800
Hey, nice sword you got there.

07:08.800 --> 07:11.100
Ain't that one of Julian's?

07:11.100 --> 07:12.290
I don't know.

07:12.290 --> 07:14.520
A member of the Migurd tribe
gave it to me.

07:14.520 --> 07:15.850
I see.

07:22.660 --> 07:25.130
Well, this here is also
one of Julian's works.

07:37.560 --> 07:38.400
Let's go.

07:59.080 --> 08:00.350
Incredible!

08:00.350 --> 08:01.500
Eris!

08:04.250 --> 08:05.750
Eris...

08:17.790 --> 08:20.430
Ghislaine, patch her up.

08:22.400 --> 08:24.780
As of today, she's a Sword Saint.

08:24.780 --> 08:27.370
I'll train her, starting tomorrow.

08:27.370 --> 08:29.150
- What?!
- Someone like her?!

08:29.850 --> 08:31.410
Master!

08:31.410 --> 08:33.150
Sword Saint is a special title,

08:33.150 --> 08:36.289
granted only to those who've mastered
Longsword of Light!

08:36.289 --> 08:38.909
Why would you give it
to a monkey like her...

08:39.789 --> 08:43.610
She beat two brats who have
mastered Longsword of Light.

08:43.610 --> 08:45.030
That's good enough for me.

08:45.030 --> 08:46.270
B-But...

08:46.270 --> 08:51.550
Someone doesn't become a Sword God
just by learning something, you know?

08:51.550 --> 08:55.230
I get none myself,
even though I'm special.

08:55.230 --> 08:58.680
So why do I need to give
the Sword Saints special treatment?

09:00.940 --> 09:03.560
My apologies, Master.

09:28.840 --> 09:30.590
Is this all you've got?

09:42.170 --> 09:46.520
Hey, do you still have time to think
about other things?

09:53.710 --> 09:56.070
Just swing your sword without
thinking about anything.

09:56.570 --> 09:58.310
Swing without thinking too much.

09:58.310 --> 10:01.070
When you're tired,
sit down and think it over.

10:01.070 --> 10:05.290
When you're tired of thinking,
stand up and swing your sword again.

10:11.180 --> 10:14.590
Huh? Ghislaine can write?

10:14.940 --> 10:16.380
It seems so.

10:16.380 --> 10:19.640
But there's no one who can read it,
so there's nothing to prove it.

10:19.640 --> 10:22.050
I thought it was a lie.

10:22.050 --> 10:24.450
Why is Father accepting
someone like her?

10:26.190 --> 10:30.320
Hey, instead of wielding a sword,
you seem better at throwing punches!

10:30.940 --> 10:32.150
You're right!

10:34.690 --> 10:36.850
Gino, say something to her!

10:36.850 --> 10:37.850
Huh?

10:39.610 --> 10:44.000
Would you like to try joining us
for practice sometime?

10:44.000 --> 10:46.040
Huh?! What are you saying?

10:46.040 --> 10:49.290
He's Father...
Sword God's direct disciple!

10:49.290 --> 10:51.210
Doesn't it make you upset, Gino?

10:51.210 --> 10:53.740
But I lost to her.

10:53.740 --> 10:57.160
You lost unfairly to someone whose style
isn't suited to the Sword God Style!

10:57.160 --> 10:59.610
There's no way you'd lose
in a proper duel!

10:59.610 --> 11:00.930
I wonder...

11:18.170 --> 11:21.010
Swinging a sword is difficult.

11:28.860 --> 11:30.920
Ghislaine is faster.

11:30.920 --> 11:33.450
Ruijerd is faster.

11:33.450 --> 11:35.670
The Sword God is even faster.

11:35.980 --> 11:39.770
And Orsted is beyond that.

11:40.740 --> 11:42.930
I need to be faster.

11:57.950 --> 12:01.180
How does the Sword God move?

12:08.220 --> 12:09.330
My grip...

12:10.720 --> 12:11.910
My stance...

12:16.600 --> 12:17.950
That's no good.

12:39.790 --> 12:41.410
Rudeus.

13:41.340 --> 13:43.260
It's still far too slow.

13:56.030 --> 13:57.690
Excuse me!

13:58.090 --> 14:00.070
Is there anyone inside?

14:00.070 --> 14:01.890
Excuse me!

14:03.070 --> 14:06.180
Thank goodness,
someone's finally arrived.

14:06.780 --> 14:08.660
I'm North Emperor, Auber...

14:08.660 --> 14:09.740
Move.

14:11.330 --> 14:13.340
What's with her?!

14:13.340 --> 14:14.540
You're in my way.

14:15.660 --> 14:18.690
I am known as Auber the Peacock Blade.

14:18.690 --> 14:20.920
I see that you're a student
of the Sword God Style.

14:21.310 --> 14:23.770
Might I request that you guide me
to meet the Sword God?

14:23.770 --> 14:26.260
I told you to move.

15:30.660 --> 15:32.230
That's enough.

15:34.140 --> 15:36.730
It has been a while, Sword God.

15:43.790 --> 15:45.840
So you came, North Emperor.

15:46.230 --> 15:49.460
I read your letter.

15:49.460 --> 15:52.510
When I called out to the dojo,
that girl attacked me.

15:52.920 --> 15:56.190
It's the first time I've seen
a swordfighter that relentless.

15:56.190 --> 15:58.900
She is almost like a beast, oh...

15:59.450 --> 16:02.250
This girl is the Mad Dog
you mentioned?

16:02.250 --> 16:04.030
Yeah, that's right.

16:25.910 --> 16:27.440
Welcome back, Eris.

16:49.950 --> 16:53.160
Master, why aren't you teaching
Eris anything?

16:53.160 --> 16:54.690
I'm teaching her, you know?

16:54.690 --> 16:56.750
You only told her to swing her sword!

16:56.750 --> 16:59.580
No, I'm teaching her to temper herself.

16:59.580 --> 17:04.190
You always said to do
everything logically.

17:04.190 --> 17:05.270
Yes, I did.

17:05.270 --> 17:07.170
So what are you doing with Eris?

17:07.170 --> 17:10.200
She's out there swinging her sword
every day like an idiot.

17:10.200 --> 17:11.849
What part of that is logical?

17:11.849 --> 17:12.640
Huh?

17:12.640 --> 17:16.060
It's been a few years, and she hasn't
mastered Longsword of Light yet.

17:16.060 --> 17:18.430
Why didn't you teach her?

17:18.430 --> 17:23.060
Since when did you become such a nag?

17:23.060 --> 17:25.740
Since before I came back here!

17:27.900 --> 17:31.530
So you aren't going to listen to what
your master tells you anymore?

17:31.990 --> 17:33.160
But...

17:33.820 --> 17:40.370
Ghislaine, I kinda regret
the way I taught you.

17:40.370 --> 17:43.310
You used to be like a starved tiger,

17:43.310 --> 17:46.590
but now you're like a kitten
without her fangs.

17:46.590 --> 17:51.590
If you'd have stayed the way you are,
you'd be a Sword Emperor by now.

17:56.450 --> 17:59.520
I'm not going to let her
lose her fangs too.

18:01.020 --> 18:02.650
I don't understand.

18:02.650 --> 18:04.730
Why won't you have her
practice like others?

18:04.730 --> 18:07.170
That's not very fair to Eris, is it?

18:09.220 --> 18:10.790
Listen, Ghislaine.

18:10.790 --> 18:15.490
If someone wants to surpass me,
they need to figure it out for themselves.

18:15.490 --> 18:19.740
But her objective is Dragon God Orsted.

18:20.450 --> 18:23.960
He's a monster beyond imagination.

18:24.370 --> 18:27.960
She can't beat him with
my teachings alone.

18:33.000 --> 18:37.170
Hey, Ghislaine,
training isn't just about practice.

18:37.170 --> 18:39.010
Especially if you have a goal,

18:39.010 --> 18:43.050
there's no point
in following someone's orders.

18:43.050 --> 18:46.170
You always say complicated things.

18:46.170 --> 18:48.010
I don't understand.

18:49.070 --> 18:53.720
In other words, it means just learning
from me won't be enough for her.

18:54.570 --> 18:56.950
That's why I have this guy.

18:56.950 --> 19:00.480
I'm North Emperor Auber Corbett.

19:00.480 --> 19:02.700
I'm also known as the Peacock Blade.

19:04.140 --> 19:06.120
What is someone from
the North God Style here?

19:06.120 --> 19:12.120
The Sword God asked me
to train one of his disciples.

19:12.120 --> 19:13.970
Why the North God Style?

19:13.970 --> 19:17.510
I don't see how their underhanded
tricks would suit Eris.

19:17.910 --> 19:20.010
Because the Dragon God used it.

19:21.670 --> 19:24.250
Just who is this Dragon God?

19:24.250 --> 19:25.880
I don't know myself.

19:25.880 --> 19:30.390
What I do know is that
he's mastered all sword styles,

19:30.390 --> 19:34.620
like Sword God Style or North God Style.

19:34.620 --> 19:38.410
Which means, he could counter
any sword styles used against him.

19:38.850 --> 19:41.260
So there's no way she can
fight him on even footing,

19:41.260 --> 19:43.040
without learning them as well.

19:43.450 --> 19:47.670
I see. Will you be calling someone
to teach her the Water God Style, too?

19:48.040 --> 19:50.710
Yeah, I already sent a letter.

19:50.710 --> 19:52.110
I see.

19:54.770 --> 19:58.300
Well then, North Emperor,
please make yourself at home.

19:58.710 --> 20:00.740
Yes, Sword King.

20:00.740 --> 20:02.930
I'm going to trouble you for a while.

20:05.930 --> 20:10.690
The wild welcome yesterday
really touched my heart.

20:10.690 --> 20:15.570
Let me check out the Mad Dog's skills
one more time.

20:17.890 --> 20:18.450
Begin!

20:45.030 --> 20:48.670
More...
I have to get stronger.

20:48.670 --> 20:51.900
Until I can stand beside Rudeus.

20:51.900 --> 20:53.900
Who is this Rudeus?

20:53.900 --> 20:58.530
I am the swordswoman,
and Rudeus is the magician.

21:01.270 --> 21:03.320
Rudeus is...

21:06.700 --> 21:09.120
Amazing!

21:29.230 --> 21:30.790
Oh! That is...!

21:30.790 --> 21:32.850
There's no mistake!
It was Longsword of Light!

21:32.850 --> 21:36.360
Its speed and power are perfect.

21:36.360 --> 21:38.030
Amazing...

21:44.910 --> 21:49.620
That was a fascinating attack.

21:49.620 --> 21:53.500
Can I request one more fight?

21:55.700 --> 21:57.250
Of course!

22:01.970 --> 22:04.970
EPISODE 01
RAGE, MAD DOG

23:34.980 --> 23:39.980
NEXT EPISODE
HOWL, MAD DOG
